	"descriptionMarkdown": "Modular just paste more if needed. \n\nEach slice require 4.5 Yumako/s, 1.80 Jellynut/s and 2.4 Nutrients/s.\n\nThe fresher the Yumako/Jellynut/Nutrient the better.\n\nSet-up:\n\n1. Left supply lane: Yumako and Nutrients (leave space for Seed output).\n2. Right supply lane: Jellynut and Nutrients (leave space for Seed output).\n3. Jump-start nutrients production by adding nutrient to the Bioflux to Nutrient Biochamber.\n4. Jump-start Pentapod Egg production by adding 2 Egg per Biochamber.\n5. Make sure the end of the supply lane doesn't clog up on the Nutrient/Seed side.\n\nShould be self-sustaining.\n\nYou can replace Quality module with Production for higher SPM, but the speed reduction must not be higher than 20% ortherwise the Egg Biochamber will overflow and may end-up hatching the Egg.\n\nAdjust Belt type as needed.",
